        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-02-10T02:47:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You win as soon as Omnitron and all his drones are destroyed.</p><p>However, since there were two cards being destroyed, he would deal the damage as soon as the first one is destroyed.&nbsp; Then you would go back to dealing the rest of the damage from the trap.</p>",
